1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:03,830
Most people use Claude like a search bar. That's a waste.

2
00:00:03,985 --> 00:00:07,010
Here are five tricks that make it way more useful.

3
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:10,395
Trick one: hit the plus button and upload your files.

4
00:00:10,445 --> 00:00:14,295
PDFs, photos, documents. Claude reads them for you.

5
00:00:14,525 --> 00:00:16,555
Trick two: create a Project.

6
00:00:16,605 --> 00:00:23,305
Add your notes and instructions once, and every chat inside it can use them. Even the free plan gets five.

7
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:25,765
Trick three: ask for an artifact.

8
00:00:25,815 --> 00:00:31,540
Say, build me a study planner, and Claude makes a real interactive tool right next to the chat.

9
00:00:31,795 --> 00:00:37,820
Trick four: don't like the answer? Edit your message and try again, instead of starting a brand new chat.

10
00:00:38,075 --> 00:00:43,275
Trick five, my favourite: end your prompt with, ask me three questions before you start.

11
00:00:43,330 --> 00:00:45,355
The answers get so much better.

12
00:00:45,610 --> 00:00:48,935
Which trick are you trying first? Tell me in the comments.

13
00:00:49,015 --> 00:00:51,840
And if you want to learn more, follow for more.

